  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Some Swedish Trees**: back after 48 archived shows (1208 days) [3]\n- **Absolute Lithops Effect**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n- **International Small Arms Traffic Blues**: back after 45 archived shows (1098 days) [3]\n- **Narakaloka**: back after 103 archived shows (3548 days); rare: 13 archived performances [3]\n- **Horseradish Road**: back after 46 archived shows (1198 days); rare: 14 archived performances [3]\n- **Mosquito Repellent**: rare: 6 archived performances; with Kaki King [3]\n- **Suedehead**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 5 archived performances; with Kaki King [3]\n- **Supergenesis**: rare: 6 archived performances; with Kaki King [3]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Black Pear Tree [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2008-10-14** (recommended): source not stated; 19 songs; 79 min [1]. Said about its sound: Audio quality is poor, making most of the performance inaudible [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Guests: Kaki King [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2008-10-14**: taped by Matt Krueger; transferred by Matt Krueger; source: Church Audio CA-11 > Church Audio STC-9000 with 10 dB gain > 1/8th inch stereo analog cable via line in jack > Edirol R-09 > SanDisk 2 GB SD Memory Card @ 16… [1]. Also: The recording was transferred to FLAC using CD Wave and Trader's Little Helper [1]",
